	(text "No external load caps on X1 / X2 (internal INTCAP): firmware must set INTCAP from CL\n(X2 8 pF, X1 9 pF = the LFXO maximum of 6-9 pF: start-up test at 1.7-3.6 V, PARTS-REVIEW\n7).\nUnused GPIO: no-connect. P2.02 reserved (VBAT_DIV_EN), P2.01 spare (D13: EN not on a\nGPIO).\nVSS_PA (pin 32) reaches GND only through NT1 at the exposed pad (Nordic note on C6).\nReset: R9 1k (reference R1) + C13 3.9pF at pin 30. Pin numbers: Nordic reference schematic\nv0.8 (L10: same table, UNVERIFIED)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 236.22 213.36 0)
